<div id="article_show_text">We have just tagged RawTherapee 5.5 Release Candidate 1. You can download it from the <a href="downloads">Downloads</a> page. To get the source code, either clone from git and checkout tag <code>5.5-rc1</code>, or get our <a href="https://rawtherapee.com/shared/source/">tarball</a> (do not use the auto-generated GitHub release tarballs). Only important bug fixes and translation updates are permitted between this release candidate and the final release. Test it and report issues in <a href="https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/issues/new">GitHub</a> or in the <a href="https://discuss.pixls.us/c/software/rawtherapee">forum</a>. If all goes well then we will release RawTherapee 5.5 final in two weeks time.</div>

